sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Eng as Engineer
    participant Git as Config repo
    participant Val as Validator
    participant Reg as Config registry
    participant Ag as Host agent
    participant Svc as Service
    participant Drift as Drift detector
    Eng->>Git: propose a config change
    Git->>Val: schema and policy checks
    alt rejected
        Val-->>Eng: fail the review — a config change is a deploy
    else accepted
        Val->>Reg: publish a new version
        Reg->>Ag: roll out by cohort
        Ag->>Svc: apply and reload
        Svc-->>Ag: healthy
        alt a cohort turns unhealthy
            Reg->>Ag: halt and roll back to the previous version
        end
    end
    loop continuously
        Drift->>Svc: read the running config
        Drift->>Reg: compare against the declared version
        Drift-->>Eng: report anything that drifted
    end
